                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "af0f5171-fa13-3cef-abd0-603094665fa0",
                                        "entry_id": "bc217263-9fbb-3afb-9aa2-accb12d79111",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Awareness of both viewpoints or matters; neutrality; rationality; objectivity."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "87087b9d-b69a-3660-9e15-7dc825d74279",
                                        "entry_id": "bc217263-9fbb-3afb-9aa2-accb12d79111",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The overall result of conflicting forces, opinions etc.; the influence which ultimately \\\"weighs\\\" more than others."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "195b8008-4b4f-416e-92d4-05dd9f17be39",
                                                "sense_id": "87087b9d-b69a-3660-9e15-7dc825d74279",
                                                "text": "The balance of power finally lay with the Royalist forces."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b83f8f28-0d8a-4d6c-abf6-93dda7399c13",
                                                "sense_id": "87087b9d-b69a-3660-9e15-7dc825d74279",
                                                "text": "I think the balance of opinion is that we should get out while we're ahead."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bff4a734-42fc-41a8-8dac-523ecf26bfa1",
                                                "sense_id": "87087b9d-b69a-3660-9e15-7dc825d74279",
                                                "text": "The shift in the balance of power online has allowed anyone to publish to the world, from dispirited teenagers in south London to an anonymous cyber-dissident in a Middle East autocracy."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b12ea117-3acd-36c6-8d5b-53bbf55aacdc",
                                        "entry_id": "bc217263-9fbb-3afb-9aa2-accb12d79111",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Apparent harmony in art (between differing colours, sounds, etc.)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
